The broker's development and test signing key, the PRIVATE half, which
config/environments/{development,test}.rb use when PROVE_KEY_PEM is unset.
The operator demos' development configuration trusts its public half.

DO NOT use in production: this file ships world-readable in a public repo, so
anyone could forge attestations signed with it. Production refuses to boot
without an explicit PROVE_KEY_PEM (config/environments/production.rb).
Generated once: openssl genpkey -algorithm ed25519
(OpenSSL tolerates this text preamble when parsing the PEM below.)

-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----
MC4CAQAwBQYDK2VwBCIEIAcszgq+WukNi8IFn37iCQ6FV+iXpWGw+Fbb8rLblPER
-----END PRIVATE KEY-----
